  "findings": [
    "Fresh current loaded Blueprint scan finds two CalculateDamageDealt caller functions with four call sites: AttackCard3807/4004 and BP_Logic.Do Units Die46/343. Every selected script independently decodes from saved bytes/FNames.",
    "Ordinary AttackCard does not read either doesDamageRecieverDie or damageRecieverKilledBeforeAattack output after either call. It consumes damage and the reverse wasShockAttack output; RULE-539 already fixed the latter.",
    "The before-attack prediction subgraph is gated by applyBeforeAttackBuffs at4031. Ordinary action passes false to all three control flags after attacker/defender direction; before-attack-kill output is false on normal/immune returns. Its true assignment at4759 belongs to that gated prediction subgraph.",
    "Do Units Die reads both death outputs. Its one observed loaded-script caller is BP_targetArrowRVX.ExecuteUbergraph at17907, feeding attack-outcome damage/death display planes (e.g.18214/18473). That observed branch is outside the user-requested headless rule kernel.",
    "MakeCardsFight712B and DamageCard786B do not call CalculateDamageDealt. Their current scripts explicitly use T37/T38 and ApplyDamageToCard. Do not add combat prediction, armor or Shock rules to them based on an assumed common calculation layer."
  ],
